    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n43783" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">septŭāgēnārĭus</span></b> ,
			a, um, adj.
		septuageni, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>of</i> or <i>belonging to the number
				seventy</i>, <i>containing seventy</i>, <i>septuagenarian</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">fistula,</span>”
				<i>seventy quarter-digits broad</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">Front. Aquaed. 56</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">homo,</span>”
				<i>a man of seventy</i>, <i>a septuagenarian</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">Dig. 50, 6, 5, § 7</span></i>
			.</div>
